{'symbol': 'EFX', 'date': '2021-12-06 07:45:00', 'title': 'EQUIFAX ANNOUNCES 2021 DEVELOPER CHALLENGE AND ACCELERATOR PROGRAM FINALISTS', 'text': 'ATLANTA, DEC. 6, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0THE 2021 EQUIFAX (NYSE: EFX) ACCELERATE PROGRAM, LAUNCHED IN JUNE , CHALLENGED U.S.-BASED START-UP AND EARLY STAGE SOFTWARE DEVELOPERS TO CREATE TRANSFORMATIVE SOLUTIONS DESIGNED TO FOSTER FINANCIAL INCLUSION AND IMPROVE ACCESS TO SERVICES WITH THE POWERFUL SUITE OF APPLICATION PROGRAMMING INTERFACES (APIS) AVAILABLE FROM THE EQUIFAX FOR DEVELOPERS API PORTAL. THE PROGRAM CONCLUDED THIS WEEK WITH 10 FINALISTS REPRESENTING A VARIETY OF INDUSTRIES, INCLUDING ESTATE ADMINISTRATION, FINANCIAL PLANNING, LENDING, FINTECH, RECRUITING, DIGITAL IDENTITY, PAYMENTS AND CLIMATE BANKING PARTICIPATING IN A FINAL PRODUCT SHOWCASE.'}